The murky water of this swampy lake looks very uninviting.	這片沼澤湖泊的水混濁不清，看起來一點也不誘人。
Large, mossy trees grow around this small, swampy lake.	這座小沼澤湖泊四周長著長滿青苔的大樹。
What a pretty bed of wildflowers.	好一片美麗的野花花圃。
An ordinary tree stands watch at the top of the hill.	山丘頂上矗立著一棵尋常的樹。
There's a bit of undergrowth scattered around the base of the tree.	樹根周圍散落著一些低矮的灌木叢。
There are many beautiful trees around Daventry.	戴凡確王國四處都有美麗的樹木。
The swift river gushes through this deep gully.	湍急的河水穿過這道深谷奔流而下。
spinning wheel	紡車
pile of gold	一堆黃金
pile of straw	一堆稻草
hole in tree	樹洞
Several nice bushes and plants surround the gnome's home.	矮人的家四周環繞著幾叢好看的灌木與植物。
The small, rickety wooden bridge is very old, but quite solid enough to support many times your weight.	這座小巧搖晃的木橋雖然老舊，卻十分堅固，足以承受你體重的好幾倍。
Many mature, graceful trees line the river's banks.	河岸兩旁排列著許多優雅的老樹。
Why, look! It's a tiny little baby tree!	咦，你看！那是一棵小小的樹苗！
A number of ordinary rocks sit in a pile here by the riverside.	河邊這裡堆著幾塊尋常的石頭。
This cluster of rocks by the river's edge controls the flow of the river.	河邊這叢岩石控制著河水的流向。
A large, healthy bush sits by the river.	河邊有一叢茂盛的大灌木。
The river ripples past the rocks.	河水泛起漣漪，流過岩石。
A few rocks project above the surface of the wildly flowing river.	幾塊岩石從奔騰的河面上突出。
You see lush plants and bushes throughout the kingdom of Daventry.	你看見戴凡確王國到處都是茂密的植物與灌木。
It is an old stone bridge, worn smooth by the ravages of weather and time.	這是一座古老的石橋，經歲月風霜侵蝕，已磨得十分光滑。
These rocky banks are damp and slippery.  Be careful not to come too close!	這片岩岸潮濕又滑溜，小心別靠得太近！
oak tree	橡樹
A stand of lovely golden oaks line the riverbank.	一排美麗的金色橡樹沿著河岸生長。
There is a beautiful pine tree by the clear blue lake.	清澈湛藍的湖邊有一棵美麗的松樹。
Several pretty trees stand by the lakeside, offering shade and beauty to wandering adventurers.	湖畔佇立著幾棵漂亮的樹，為漂泊的冒險者提供樹蔭與美景。
Rocks lie along the edge of the lake, adding to the quiet serenity of the area.	岩石沿著湖邊散落，為這片地方增添了寧靜安詳的氣息。
Some pretty flowering bushes grow in a bunch near the lake's edge.	湖邊叢生著幾株漂亮的開花灌木。
There are still a few graceful pines standing near the woodcutter's cottage.	樵夫的小屋附近還立著幾棵優雅的松樹。
These tree stumps sit where mighty trees once stood.	這些樹樁曾是參天大樹佇立的地方。
This crude porch looks like it has seen better days.	這個簡陋的門廊看起來已經風光不再。
Bushes grow here and there around the front of the woodcutter's house.	樵夫小屋前四處長著灌木。
The tree was cut from this stump long ago.	這棵樹早在很久以前就從這個樹樁上被砍下了。
This old cottage is sagging and in great need of repair.	這間老舊小屋已經傾頹，亟需修繕。
This log, felled long ago, awaits the woodcutter's fire.	這根很久以前砍下的原木，正等著送進樵夫的爐火。
This beautiful pine tree adorns the woodcutter's back yard.	這棵美麗的松樹點綴著樵夫家的後院。
Some large trees still overhang the woodcutter's house.	幾棵大樹仍舊籠罩在樵夫小屋上方。
There is a moldering old stump here, rotting to pieces.	這裡有一截腐朽的老樹樁，正逐漸腐爛崩解。
The trees here are stunted and twisted.  They give you the heebie-jeebies.	這裡的樹木長得又矮又扭曲，讓你覺得毛骨悚然。
There are numerous small rocks and boulders in this part of the forest.	森林的這個角落散布著許多小石頭與巨石。
Even in this slightly dismal part of the forest, the bushes grow well in the bright Daventry sun.	即使在森林這片略顯陰鬱的角落，灌木也在戴凡確王國的燦爛陽光下長得很好。
Several unimpressive little trees have grown in the sandy soil of the forest.	幾棵不起眼的小樹在森林的沙質土壤中長了出來。
castle	城堡
rock in river	河中的岩石
There's an impressive cliff here, overlooking the castle and the small waterfall.	這裡有一座氣勢驚人的懸崖，俯瞰著城堡與小瀑布。
This is just one of the many leafy bushes growing throughout the countryside.	這只是鄉間到處生長的茂密灌木之一。
This is a wild and perilous raging river, filled with jagged boulders and treacherous rapids.	這是一條狂野危險的怒河，佈滿嶙峋巨石與凶險的急流。
An old tree hangs over the river's rapids.	一棵老樹懸垂在河流的急流上方。
This extremely old tree stump has nearly splintered completely away.	這截極為古老的樹樁幾乎已經完全碎裂殆盡。
The steep face of the cliff is sheer, featureless rock.	這片陡峭的懸崖是毫無特徵的光禿岩壁。
A small, commonplace bush grows by the hole in the ground.	地上的洞穴旁長著一叢不起眼的小灌木。
Several small, ordinary rocks are scattered around the part of the forest.	森林的這片角落散落著幾塊尋常的小石頭。
Plenty of thick, healthy shrubbery grows here.	這裡長滿了茂密健康的灌木叢。
You've sunk your chances for saving Daventry.	你拯救戴凡確王國的機會就此沉沒了。
The sides of the well are damp and covered with algae and lichen.	井壁又濕又滑，覆滿了藻類與地衣。
The well-water is cold and clear.	井水冰涼又清澈。
fire ball	火球
dragon's head	巨龍的頭
Your shield melted from the intensity of the dragon's flames!  Looks like the dragon made an ash out of you.	你的盾牌被巨龍猛烈的火焰融化了！看來巨龍把你燒成了灰燼。
By venturing too close to the dragon's flame, you made an ash out of yourself.	你冒險靠巨龍的火焰太近，把自己燒成了灰燼。
Well, well, well!  Water you going to do now?	哎呀，哎呀，哎呀！看來你就這麼付諸東流了。
royal subject	王室臣民
person's head	人頭
Thick, puffy clouds can be found everywhere you look up here, as you might expect!	一如你所料，這裡放眼望去到處都是厚實蓬鬆的雲朵！
These weirdly-shaped trees tower over you.	這些形狀怪異的樹木高聳在你頭頂上。
Clouds rim the land here.  Wispy towards the edges, they appear to grow thicker in the distance.	這裡的陸地邊緣環繞著雲朵，邊緣稀薄如絲，越往遠處看起來越濃密。
The trees here are astonishingly tall; they loom over the land above the clouds.  You can barely see the tops!	這裡的樹木高得驚人，聳立在雲層之上的陸地上方，你幾乎看不到樹梢！
Thick, cottony clouds surround the land up here, obscuring your view of Daventry far below.	濃密如棉花的雲朵環繞著這片高處的陸地，遮住了你俯瞰遠方戴凡確王國的視線。
The colossal, weirdly-shaped trees loom far overhead.	巨大而形狀怪異的樹木高高聳立在你頭頂上方。
The land trails off into the thick clouds here; though they look almost solid, you'd best be careful where you walk.	這裡的陸地漸漸沒入濃密的雲層之中；雲朵看起來幾乎堅實，但你最好還是走路小心。
These gigantic, weirdly-shaped trees tower over you.	這些形狀怪異的巨大樹木高聳在你頭頂上。
The clouds drift over the edge of the land here, making it impossible to see where the land ends!  Though the clouds look very thick, it would be unwise to venture too far out into them.	雲朵在這裡的陸地邊緣飄移，讓人根本看不出陸地在哪裡終止！雲朵雖然看起來很濃密，貿然深入其中並非明智之舉。
The immense, oddly-shaped trees loom over you.	巨大而形狀奇特的樹木聳立在你頭頂上方。
There is a small, dark hole in the base of this tree.	這棵樹的樹根處有一個小小的黑洞。
You can barely make out the cave opening to the north.	你幾乎看不清北方的洞穴入口。
The dense clouds start to flow over the land here.  Somewhere just out in those clouds the land comes to an end; better be careful where you walk!	濃密的雲層開始從這片陸地上流過，陸地就在雲層之外的某處終止；走路最好小心一點！
golden egg	金蛋
Up here in the tree, the main trunk is bent enough to allow you to walk carefully along its length. The leaves and branches hide the ground from view.	樹上這裡，主幹彎曲的程度剛好能讓你小心翼翼地沿著它行走。枝葉遮住了下方的地面，讓你看不見。
spider web	蜘蛛網
The walls of this cave are rough and craggy.	這座洞穴的牆壁粗糙嶙峋。
The ceiling is low and rough here.	這裡的天花板又低又粗糙。
The cave appears to open up into a larger chamber that reaches deep into the mountain.	這座洞穴似乎通向一個更大的洞室，深入山體內部。
overhead walkway	高架走道
There is a wooden walkway suspended from the cave's ceiling.	洞穴的天花板上懸吊著一條木製走道。
You can't see much of anything in the dark cave.	在這座漆黑的洞穴裡，你幾乎什麼都看不見。
The beanstalk must be ten feet around!  It's incredibly tall...so tall that it vanishes in the clouds far, far above you.  There are plenty of footholds among the vines and offshoots of the beanstalk's stem.	這根豆莖的周長少說也有十呎！高得不可思議……高到消失在你頭頂遙遠的雲層裡。豆莖主幹上的藤蔓與分枝間，有許多可以踩踏的立足點。
In the distance, and far above you, you can see heavy, dense clouds in streaks across the sky.  You think they're cumulus clouds, but it's been a long time since you went to Daventry High School.	在遠方，也在你頭頂高高之上，你看見濃密厚重的雲朵在天空中成條劃過。你覺得那應該是積雲，不過你上戴凡確高中已經是很久以前的事了。
You can see neither the top nor the bottom of the gigantic beanstalk you're clinging to.  The ropey green vines easily hold your weight, and the massive main stem winds gently upward.	你攀附著的這根巨大豆莖，上看不到頂、下看不到底。粗如繩索的綠色藤蔓輕鬆撐住你的體重，龐大的主幹緩緩向上蜿蜒。
There are clouds all around you.  You can see neither the land below you nor the top of the beanstalk above you.  In fact, there's little to see up here but clouds and the occasional bird.	你四周全是雲朵。你既看不見下方的陸地，也看不見上方豆莖的頂端。事實上，這裡除了雲朵和偶爾飛過的鳥，幾乎沒什麼可看的。
At long last, you see the tip of the beanstalk, thinning and curling as it emerges from the cloud layer below.	終於，你看見豆莖的頂端，它從下方的雲層中冒出，逐漸變細並捲曲。
What a beautiful sight!  The clouds stretch out in every direction beyond you; near the beanstalk, they even seem thick enough to stand on!	好一幅美麗的景象！雲朵向你四周的每個方向延展開來；靠近豆莖的地方，雲朵看起來甚至厚實得可以站上去！
You can see a circle of light on the floor of the cave, shining down from the hole above.	你看見洞穴地面上有一圈光，從上方的洞口灑落下來。
A shaft of sunlight from above pierces the gloom of the cave.	一道陽光從上方射入，穿透了洞穴的幽暗。
To the north, you can still see the light shining through the hole in the ceiling.	往北望去，你仍能看見光線從天花板的洞口照射進來。
rat gut	老鼠的內臟
rat's eyes	老鼠的眼睛
Rats!  This was one shady character you shouldn't have tangled with.	可惡的老鼠！你就不該跟這個鬼祟的傢伙糾纏上。
getHim!	getHim!
The huge wooden columns help support the cave ceiling.	巨大的木柱撐住了洞穴的天花板。
The light shines through a small hole.	光線透過一個小洞照射進來。
woodcutter's wife	樵夫的妻子
There is a rickety old cupboard on the wall.	牆上有一個搖搖欲墜的老舊櫥櫃。
There is a small, threadbare carpet on the floor.	地板上鋪著一張破舊的小地毯。
The old nightstand is nothing more than a small plain table at the foot of the bed.	這張老舊床頭櫃，其實只是床腳邊一張樸素的小桌子。
A sturdy stone bridge has been built here to span the moat.	這裡建有一座堅固的石橋，橫跨護城河。
The forest is slowly encroaching on the castle grounds; there are tall, ancient trees everywhere you look.	森林正逐漸侵蝕城堡的領地；放眼望去到處都是高聳的古樹。
Turn on	開啟
Turn off	關閉
Use the mouse or right and left arrow keys to set the sound volume.	使用滑鼠或左右方向鍵調整音量。
Sound Volume	音量
Louder	較大聲
Softer	較小聲
The witch has turned you into a gingerbread man.  Or is that a Graham cracker?	巫婆把你變成了薑餅人。還是說，那其實是格拉漢餅乾？
Dialog	對話框
Controls	操作設定
The moat monsters appreciate your good taste.	護城河裡的怪物很欣賞你的好品味。
moat monster	護城河怪物
monster's tail	怪物的尾巴
The raging current pulls you under, never to be found.	洶湧的水流把你捲入水底，從此再也找不到你。
Looks like you had a bad fall this spring.	看來你這個春天摔得可真慘。
The mushroom wore off and you enlarged.  But you can't squeeze a five-foot Knight into a 6-inch hole!	蘑菇的效力消退，你變回原本的大小了。但你沒辦法把一位五呎高的騎士塞進一個六吋寬的洞裡！
You were warned ogre and ogre again...	你已經被鬼怪一次又一次警告過了……
Feature	功能
Wander	遊蕩
Follow	跟隨
Chase	追逐
Timer	計時器
Grooper	Grooper
Grycler	Grycler
